{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The arrangement is centered around a backpack. For every lemon in the scene, it is placed to the left of the backpack. To the right of the backpack is a shirt. Positioned to the right of the shirt is a cutting board. A sandwich, which is smaller than the cutting board, is located to the right of the cutting board. To the right of the sandwich is a phone. Finally, a pair of pliers is placed to the right of the phone and is located on the bottom side of the image.",
